      "gameKey": "custom/007/CtsMjiSpecialShop_00789#TEXT_CTSMJISPECIALSHOP_00789_OMISE_200_000",
      "en": "Hello there! I'm a simple collector of things, trinkets, curios, whatsits, and thingamabobs, in case you were wondering. Can you have them? Absolutely not. They are mine, and mine alone. And maybe sometimes the owner's, if I'm feeling charitable.",
